ght -Sorely needed quality win against that team down east. Got to feel good to get back at the team that humiliated us on\u2026", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:s5krspdfohz6zk24ozr2yyjj/bafkreiguarpe75daqzfnzqcrkdthbqpqr2uua4lmwg4lewg4nkcncy5vwu"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-07T23:42:35.877Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzr357yhkk26", "cid": "bafyreicblvwqgy7y2xd6ywzbvuszhqoo5zvrs4vtq4hxvnno5bq24nvtty", "author": {"did": "did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc", "handle": "mikeascotto.bsky.social", "displayName": "Michael Scotto", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/bafkreiegqo54izmuc42h4iy5zzmdw4gvwbtwiayjruoqxy3tifeofydl2q", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-14T07:41:46.878Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lzhoq6rz752j", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-09-23T00:39:47.067Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-07T23:41:59.525Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreifiqi7lh2tyjsvf56tw2cs4xm4u3laiovmkeygx3f7773xf74rvgm", "uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlh2mh3zc2t"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "The Cleveland Cavaliers have signed forward Riley Minix to a two-way contract and have waived injured two-way forward Tristan Enaruna.\n\nMinix was recently waived to make room for two-way forward Norchad Omier."}, "embed": {"record": {"uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlh2mh3zc2t", "cid": "bafyreifiqi7lh2tyjsvf56tw2cs4xm4u3laiovmkeygx3f7773xf74rvgm", "author": {"did": "did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc", "handle": "mikeascotto.bsky.social", "displayName": "Michael Scotto", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/bafkreiegqo54izmuc42h4iy5zzmdw4gvwbtwiayjruoqxy3tifeofydl2q", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-14T07:41:46.878Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lzhoq6rz752j", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-09-23T00:39:47.067Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "value": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-05T17:59:18.398Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreibqnkelnudxlkff5ywpelpywfv4p72fm32mdbeoqx4smcudxhjnnm", "uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzhifuiwvc23"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "The Cleveland Cavaliers plan to waive two-way forward Riley Minix, league sources told HoopsHype. Minix averaged 18.0 points on 51.9% shooting from the field and 42.8% from 3-point range, 6.6 rebounds, 3.0 assists, and 1.3 steals per game in the G League last season."}, "labels": [], "likeCount": 4, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 1, "quoteCount": 2, "indexedAt": "2026-11-05T17:59:18.677Z", "embeds": [{"record": {"uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzhifuiwvc23", "cid": "bafyreibqnkelnudxlkff5ywpelpywfv4p72fm32mdbeoqx4smcudxhjnnm", "author": {"did": "did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc", "handle": "mikeascotto.bsky.social", "displayName": "Michael Scotto", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/bafkreiegqo54izmuc42h4iy5zzmdw4gvwbtwiayjruoqxy3tifeofydl2q", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-14T07:41:46.878Z", "verification": {"verifications": [{"issuer": "did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur", "issuerDisplayName": "Bluesky", "issuerHandle": "bsky.app", "uri": "at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lzhoq6rz752j", "isValid": true, "createdAt": "2025-09-23T00:39:47.067Z"}], "verifiedStatus": "valid", "trustedVerifierStatus": "none"}}, "value": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-04T04:12:50.735Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreihmbbf2fentp5hyhi55uu2s6l5gpdagfzacnntmtgtzqeqw4llvza", "uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzgegxq3vk22"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "Update: After agreeing to a two-way deal with the Minnesota Timberwolves, Norchad Omier has changed his mind and plans to sign a two-way deal with the Cleveland Cavaliers, sources told HoopsHype.\n\nThe Timberwolves now have an open two-way spot after waiving Enrique Freeman."}, "labels": [], "likeCount": 16, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 2, "quoteCount": 8, "indexedAt": "2026-11-04T04:12:50.971Z", "$type": "app.bsky.embed.record#viewRecord"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.record#view"}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.record#viewRecord"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.record#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 1, "likeCount": 5, "quoteCount": 1, "indexedAt": "2026-11-07T23:41:59.870Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:uf6566ur4zv2h7yl4les2ygh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzqz443php2t", "cid": "bafyreif4kidyv5p7ol4ibqzocycfmjgd4p6njtoynbyreovfx7vt6hgn7e", "author": {"did": "did:plc:uf6566ur4zv2h7yl4les2ygh", "handle": "umlegacypress.com", "displayName": "UM LEGACY PRESS LTD", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uf6566ur4zv2h7yl4les2ygh/bafkreichh6dj43p55adyghf3pzt4mdosk3esshjoijcxfvqrurrgdpgdwm", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription":